Built on NVIDIA Cosmos.
jaga uses NVIDIA Cosmos-Embed1-224p (https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Cosmos-Embed1-224p), licensed by NVIDIA
Corporation under the NVIDIA Open Model License. The model weights are not included in this repository: they are
downloaded from Hugging Face under that licence. The committed vectors under fixtures/ are outputs of the model.

jaga calls NVIDIA Nemotron 3 Super (nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b) through Nebius Token Factory.

Fonts in jaga/static/fonts/ are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (the licence texts sit beside
the fonts): Big Shoulders Stencil, Atkinson Hyperlegible Next, IBM Plex Mono.
